| Command | Skill |
|---------|-------|
| `/api-spec` | `.cursor/skills/api-spec/SKILL.md` |
| `/api-update-spec` | `.cursor/skills/api-update-spec/SKILL.md` |
| `/grill-api-spec` | `.cursor/skills/grill-api-spec/SKILL.md` |

Extracts: `spec-evolution.md`, `api-spec-sync.md`, `entity-relationship.md`, `derived-data.md`, `call-external.md`, `cross-entity-service.md`, `api-codegen-readiness.md`, `api-codegen-tags.md`, `agent-discipline.md`

